{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c20513a-db0e-11ef-afd8-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c1dc752-db0e-11ef-9ac7-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渝","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"箕州","place_name_jianti_auto":"箕州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bca77721-db0e-11ef-aa7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"儀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"仪州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bca77722-db0e-11ef-802d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"先天元年，避帝名，改箕州爲儀州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"先天元年，避帝名，改箕州为仪州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"bca77720-db0e-11ef-a6b9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渝","place_name_jianti_auto":"渝","place_note":"重庆","resolved_place_entity_id":2039,"start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"bca7772b-db0e-11ef-b95b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"15宋璟奏：「括州員外司馬李邕、儀州司馬鄭勉，並有才略文詞，但性多異端，好是非改變；若全引進，則咎悔必至，若長棄捐，則才用可惜，請除渝、硤二州刺史。」又奏：「大理卿元行沖素稱才行，初用之時，實允僉議；當事之後，頗非稱職，請復以爲左散騎常侍，以李朝隱代之。陸象先閑於政體，寬不容非，請以爲河南尹。」從之。","content_fanyi":"宋璟上奏说：“括州员外司马李邕、仪州司马郑勉，都有才能、谋略和文辞，只是性情多持异见，喜欢议论是非、更改旧规；如果完全引进重用，灾祸和悔恨必定会到来，如果长期弃置不用，又可惜了他们的才能，请求分别任命他们为渝、硤二州刺史。”又上奏说：“大理寺卿元行冲素来以才华品行著称，最初任用他时，确实符合众人的评议；但任事之后，很不称职，请求再任命他为左散骑常侍，用李朝隐接替其职。陆象先熟悉为政的要领，为人宽厚而不纵容过错，请求任命他为河南尹。”皇上采纳了这些建议。","content_jianti_auto":"15宋璟奏：「括州员外司马李邕、仪州司马郑勉，并有才略文词，但性多异端，好是非改变；若全引进，则咎悔必至，若长弃捐，则才用可惜，请除渝、硖二州刺史。」又奏：「大理卿元行冲素称才行，初用之时，实允佥议；当事之后，颇非称职，请复以为左散骑常侍，以李朝隐代之。陆象先闲于政体，宽不容非，请以为河南尹。」从之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21229,"number":15,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百一十二 (唐紀二十八) / 玄宗至道大聖大明孝皇帝上之下 / 開元六年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bca7771f-db0e-11ef-ad6b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":718},"tongjian_id":"bca7771f-db0e-11ef-ad6b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渝","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"豐都","place_name_jianti_auto":"丰都","place_note":"重庆市丰都县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c77b9643-db0e-11ef-82b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c77b9644-db0e-11ef-a372-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c77b9645-db0e-11ef-bbec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"枳縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"枳县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c77b9646-db0e-11ef-b650-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c77b9647-db0e-11ef-b2cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平都縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"平都县","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c77b9648-db0e-11ef-9bdf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"c77b9649-db0e-11ef-bcb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨江郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"临江郡","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"c77b964a-db0e-11ef-aaf4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"c77b964b-db0e-11ef-82eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨江","place_name_jianti_auto":"临江","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"c77b964c-db0e-11ef-b5c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"豐都縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"丰都县","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"c77b964d-db0e-11ef-92c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"c77b964e-db0e-11ef-8ce0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"忠州","place_name_jianti_auto":"忠州","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"c77b964f-db0e-11ef-b16e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"豐都，漢巴郡枳縣地，後漢置平都縣，因山以名縣也。梁置臨江郡，隋廢郡爲縣。義寧二年，分臨江置豐都縣。唐屬忠州。九域志：在州西九十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"丰都，汉巴郡枳县地，后汉置平都县，因山以名县也。梁置临江郡，隋废郡为县。义宁二年，分临江置丰都县。唐属忠州。九域志：在州西九十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"c77b9642-db0e-11ef-9426-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渝","place_name_jianti_auto":"渝","place_note":"重庆市","resolved_place_entity_id":2039,"start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"c77d91cd-db0e-11ef-8dea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、重庆府（卷六十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"今废。○僰溪水驿，在县治西。又西六十里有石羊水驿。百二十...","context_before":"...坝驿[在县东。《唐志》：江津县有茅坝驿，蜀人谓平川为坝。","source_end_index":74,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f11ba12b-2fb8-5847-aad8-8ee242931809","source_start_index":29,"source_text":"唐乾宁三年，荆南将许存为万州刺史，不容于大帅，成汭遣兵袭之，存走屯于茅坝，降于王建，即此。"},{"context_after":"又后唐长兴初，孟知祥将朱偓侵涪州，武泰帅杨汉宾弃黔南奔忠...","context_before":"...临江县。隋义宁二年，分临江，置丰都县，属临州。唐属忠州。","source_end_index":146,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b9a95b46-174a-511f-9f23-0a6a721899a1","source_start_index":86,"source_text":"乾宁二年，荆南帅成汭与其将许存溯江略地，黔中帅王建肇弃黔州，收余众保丰都，汭将赵武自黔中数攻丰都，建肇不能守，降于王建。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/五、重庆府（卷六十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"24荊南節度使成汭與其將許存泝江略地，盡取濱江州縣，武泰節度使王建肇棄黔州，收餘衆保豐都。存又引兵西取渝、涪二州，汭以其將趙武爲黔中留後，存爲萬州刺史。","content_fanyi":"荆南节度使成汭与他的部将许存沿长江逆流而上侵夺土地，将沿岸州县全部攻取，武泰节度使王建肇放弃黔州，收集残余部众退保丰都。许存又领兵向西攻取渝、涪二州，成汭任命部将赵武为黔中留后，许存为万州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"24荆南节度使成汭与其将许存溯江略地，尽取滨江州县，武泰节度使王建肇弃黔州，收余众保丰都。存又引兵西取渝、涪二州，汭以其将赵武为黔中留后，存为万州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":26874,"number":24,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百六十 (唐紀七十六) / 昭宗聖穆景文孝皇帝上之下 / 三年 / 第 25 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"c77b9641-db0e-11ef-890f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":896},"tongjian_id":"c77b9641-db0e-11ef-890f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渝","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渝","place_name_jianti_auto":"渝","place_note":"重庆市","resolved_place_entity_id":2039,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"c7ae5a56-db0e-11ef-be13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"30己丑，東川留後王宗滌言於王建，以東川封疆五千里，文移往還，動踰數月，請分遂、合、瀘、渝、昌五州別爲一鎭；建表言之。","content_fanyi":"九月二十二日己丑，东川留后王宗涤向王建进言说：“东川受封的疆域有五千里，公文往来传送，动辄要好几个月，请分出遂、合、泸、渝、昌五州另设一镇。”王建上表向唐昭宗奏报此事。","content_jianti_auto":"30己丑，东川留后王宗涤言于王建，以东川封疆五千里，文移往还，动逾数月，请分遂、合、泸、渝、昌五州别为一镇；建表言之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":27000,"number":30,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百六十一 (唐紀七十七) / 昭宗聖穆景文孝皇帝中之上 / 光化元年 / 第 31 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"c7ae5a4d-db0e-11ef-9c1d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":898},"tongjian_id":"c7ae5a4d-db0e-11ef-9c1d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渝","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"桔柏","place_name_jianti_auto":"桔柏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cb606846-db0e-11ef-be1b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"cb606847-db0e-11ef-91b4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"桔柏浮梁爲蜀所斷，故脩之以濟。","note_content_jianti_auto":"桔柏浮梁为蜀所断，故修之以济。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"cb606845-db0e-11ef-8ced-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","place_note":"首都成都府【四川省成都市】王宗衍本年二十七岁","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cb606849-db0e-11ef-85a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"昭武","place_name_jianti_auto":"昭武","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"cb60684a-db0e-11ef-b675-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"利州","place_name_jianti_auto":"利州","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"cb60684b-db0e-11ef-87af-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"利州","place_name_jianti_auto":"利州","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"cb60684c-db0e-11ef-860c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"閬州","place_name_jianti_auto":"阆州","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"cb60684d-db0e-11ef-ad23-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蜀置昭武節度於利州。九域志：利州東南至閬州二百三十五里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"蜀置昭武节度于利州。九域志：利州东南至阆州二百三十五里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"cb606848-db0e-11ef-b548-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"劍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"剑州","place_note":"四川剑阁","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"cb606850-db0e-11ef-a6cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"利州","place_name_jianti_auto":"利州","place_note":"四川广元市","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"cb606851-db0e-11ef-826f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"九域志：劍州東北至利州一百九十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"九域志：剑州东北至利州一百九十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"cb60684f-db0e-11ef-bd90-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","place_note":"首都成都府【四川省成都市】王宗衍本年二十七岁","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cb606854-db0e-11ef-965a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武信軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"武信军","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"cb606855-db0e-11ef-b83e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遂州","place_name_jianti_auto":"遂州","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"cb606856-db0e-11ef-b781-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蜀置武信軍於遂州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"蜀置武信军于遂州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"cb606853-db0e-11ef-a3ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渝","place_name_jianti_auto":"渝","place_note":"重庆","resolved_place_entity_id":2039,"start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"cb606865-db0e-11ef-bd73-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、保宁府（卷六十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"明年军还，绍琛以兵叛，遂断桔柏津浮梁，以绝还军之道。宋乾...","context_before":"...柏津，宦者杨光复恶之，使其假子山南西道帅杨守亮覆诸江中。","source_end_index":152,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"64e6b728-a7f0-56e1-8b74-8942243cf9e1","source_start_index":99,"source_text":"后唐同光三年，伐蜀，蜀兵大败于三泉。时蜀主在利州，遂西走，断桔柏津浮梁。唐前锋将李绍琛至利州，修浮梁以渡。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/二、保宁府（卷六十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"戊戌，李紹琛至利州，脩桔柏浮梁。昭武節度使林思諤先棄城奔閬州，遣使請降。甲辰，魏王繼岌至劍州，蜀武信節度使兼中書令王宗壽以遂、合、渝、瀘、昌五州降。","content_fanyi":"戊戌日，李绍琛抵达利州，修筑桔柏浮桥。昭武节度使林思谔此前已弃城逃往阆州，派遣使者请求投降。甲辰日，魏王李继岌到达剑州，蜀武信节度使兼中书令王宗寿率领遂、合、渝、泸、昌五州归降。","content_jianti_auto":"戊戌，李绍琛至利州，修桔柏浮梁。昭武节度使林思谔先弃城奔阆州，遣使请降。甲辰，魏王继岌至剑州，蜀武信节度使兼中书令王宗寿以遂、合、渝、泸、昌五州降。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28453,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十四 (後唐紀三) / 莊宗光聖神閔孝皇帝下 / 同光三年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"cb606844-db0e-11ef-a21f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":925},"tongjian_id":"cb606844-db0e-11ef-a21f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":4},"place_name":"渝"},"message":"success","success":true}